WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.145 --> 00:01:07.665
song The pals saw a hole.

2
00:01:08.385 --> 00:01:14.409
Pink: What is in it?

3
00:01:22.714 --> 00:01:23.794
Green got a rope.

4
00:01:27.917 --> 00:01:29.157
He put it in the hole.

5
00:01:31.759 --> 00:01:33.440
The pals went down the rope.

6
00:01:40.652 --> 00:01:41.993
Pink saw a cone.

7
00:01:42.913 --> 00:01:47.395
Pink: I like this cone.

8
00:01:48.495 --> 00:01:49.856
Yellow saw a rose.

9
00:01:50.476 --> 00:01:53.577
Yellow: I like this rose.

10
00:01:53.717 --> 00:02:05.762
Green: Oh no!

11
00:02:06.243 --> 00:02:07.423
Here comes a mole!

12
00:02:07.843 --> 00:02:11.393
Mole: This is my home!

13
00:02:17.858 --> 00:02:18.718
The mole was mad.

14
00:02:18.758 --> 00:02:23.121
Mole: Give me my cone.

15
00:02:24.302 --> 00:02:25.523
Give me my rose.

16
00:02:27.324 --> 00:02:31.087
Green: Let's go home!

17
00:02:36.091 --> 00:02:37.552
The pals went up the rope!
